s58:s56,s54:div0d |- ( ( ( N e. NN /\ W e. ZZ ) /\ -. N || W ) -> ( 0 / ( 1 - ( ( -u 1 ^c ( 2 / N ) ) ^ W ) ) ) = 0 )
